    "traits": "Consumable Herb",
    "description": "<strong>Usage held in 1 hand; Activate Interact (2 AP).</strong>\n\nTerrain: cursed gardens and temperate ruins.\n\nRose of thorns produces a small, intensely red flower within a cage of black barbs. The plant is often found in ruined gardens where betrayal or violent jealousy once ended a household, though gardeners dispute whether this is cause or superstition. Its thick crimson sap is collected from the thorns and mixed into a clinging weapon dressing. You smear it over one melee weapon or up to 10 pieces of ammunition. The preparation remains potent for 1 minute. The first creature damaged by the treated weapon takes 2 bleed damage, after which the dose is expended.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 6.",
